Khairiyat Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Chhichhore sung by Arijit Singh.

Strumming Pattern: DD UDUD DDU

{c: Intro} [Cm] [Cm] [A#] [G#] [X2]

[Cm]Khairiyat [A#]pucho,        Kabhi to [G#]kaifiyat [A#]pucho
Tumhaare [Fm]bin diwaane [A#]ka,        Kya haal [G]hai

[Cm]Dil mera [A#]dekho,        Na meri [G#]haisiyat [A#]pucho
Tere [Fm]bin ek din [A#]jaise,        Sau saal [G]hai

Anjaam [Fm]hai tay [A#]mera,        Hona [C]tumhe hai [G#]mera
Kitni bhi [A#]ho [Gm]dooriyaan,        filhal [G]hai
[A#]Yeh dooriyaan [G#]filhal [G]hai

