Tumhari [Cm]tasveer ke [G#]sahare,        [Cm]Mausam kayi [G#]guzaare
[Fm]Mausami naa [G#]smjho,        Parr [A#]ishq ko [G]humare

[Cm]Nazaaro ke [G#]samne me,        [Cm]Aata nhi [G#]tumhare
Magar [Fm]rhte ho [G#]har pal,        [A#]Manzar me tum [G]humare

Gar ishq [Fm]se hai [A#]mila,        Fir dard [C]se kya [G#]gila
